Subject: [PATCH] fix(#2615): reduce ssti vectors for thymeleaf

* fix: thymeleaf ssti

* feat(ci): add semgrep scan

* chore: formatting

* chore: remove redundant vulnerable file
---
 .github/workflows/vulnerability-scan.yml      | 25 +++++++
 .../AdminServerNotifierAutoConfiguration.java |  7 +-
 .../notify/MailNotifierIntegrationTest.java   | 74 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../admin/server/notify/vulnerable-file.html  | 30 ++++++++
 4 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/vulnerability-scan.yml
 create mode 100644 spring-boot-admin-server/src/test/java/de/codecentric/boot/admin/server/notify/MailNotifierIntegrationTest.java
